nvidia-kmod-open for Sparky Stereo OS
=====================================

The upstream tarball nvidia-kmod-open_615.71.09.orig.tar.xz is the DKMS
source tree /usr/src/nvidia-615.71.09 of NVIDIA's own binary package
nvidia-kernel-open-dkms_615.71.09-2_amd64.deb (SHA-256
5d49df263cf077dce2cbe97248e4aa32be1eba32ff16c0424fc80ed92b320602), from
https://developer.download.nvidia.com/compute/cuda/repos/debian13/x86_64/,
unmodified. NVIDIA's CUDA repository publishes no source packages, so the
packaging in debian/ is ours; the binary package keeps NVIDIA's control
fields, file layout and DKMS configuration.

debian/patches holds the commits of the stereo3d branch of
https://github.com/danielcamposramos/open-gpu-kernel-modules over 615.71.09.
